	(text "U1: DVDD on +5V; its LDO sets AVDD to 4.2 V (VLDO = 001, AVDDS = 1).\nAVDD feeds REFP and the bridge (E+): the reading is ratiometric.\nR1, R2 and C7: input filter of the datasheet circuit. C8 (Cfilter, 680 pF) on VIN2: set PGA_CAP_EN.\nInternal RC oscillator: XIN and XOUT open. DRDY open: the firmware polls CR.\nI2C address 0x2A. Disable the weak pull-ups (WPD). Never enable CRSD: it holds SDA low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 35.56 140.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fd1a6cba-49e5-4a90-9925-5cbcc5c9e2c6")
	)
